      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "因为我常来这附近买自己喜欢的东西，所以\r\n对这儿的地理环境比较熟悉。尽～管交给我吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a36a2efe6c11d17cef6e367270ed4411fb30a5a3344f275fef4b7c520eb1ff53",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
